  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nkanga Tuhurukire Coffee Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Coffee. Beneficiaries: 440 Farmers: 251 Male &amp; 189 female. Description: EEG grant for a coffee cooperative in order for them to increase their production through the provision of working capital, procurement of a truck that will transport farmers produce to the processing facility and motorcycles for field officers to provide extension services to farmers which will lead to improved quality and increased production and hence increased farmers&apos; incomes.</narrative>
  </description>
